[
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P1-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P1-S1",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Everybody loves a fat pay rise.",
    "translation": "每个人都喜欢大幅加薪。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P1-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P1-S2",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Yet pleasure at your own can vanish if you learn that a colleague has been given a bigger one.",
    "translation": "然而，如果你得知同事得到了更大的礼物，你自己的快乐就会消失。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P1-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P1-S3",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Indeed, if he has a reputation for slacking, you might even be outraged.",
    "translation": "事实上，如果他有偷懒的名声，你甚至可能会感到愤怒。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P1-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P1-S4",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "Such behaviour is regarded as \"all too human\", with the underlying assumption that other animals would not be capable of this finely developed sense of grievance.",
    "translation": "这种行为被认为“太人性化了”，其基本假设是其他动物不具备这种精细发展的不满感。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P1-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P1-S5",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "But a study by Sarah Brosnan and Frans de Waal of Emory University in Atlanta, Georgia, which has just been published in Nature, suggests that it is all too monkey, as well.",
    "translation": "但佐治亚州亚特兰大埃默里大学的莎拉·布罗斯南和弗兰斯·德瓦尔刚刚在《自然》杂志上发表的一项研究表明，这也太像猴子了。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P1-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P1-S6",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "The researchers studied the behaviour of female brown capuchin monkeys.",
    "translation": "研究人员研究了雌性棕色卷尾猴的行为。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 1,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P1-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P1-S7",
      "pIndex": 1
    },
    "text": "They look cute.",
    "translation": "它们看起来很可爱。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P2-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P2-S1",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "They are good-natured, co-operative creatures, and they share their food readily.",
    "translation": "它们是性情善良、善于合作的生物，并且乐于分享食物。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P2-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P2-S2",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Above all, like their female human counterparts, they tend to pay much closer attention to the value of \"goods and services\" than males.",
    "translation": "最重要的是，与女性人类同行一样，她们往往比男性更关注“商品和服务”的价值。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P2-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P2-S3",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Such characteristics make them perfect candidates for Dr. Brosnan's and Dr. de Waal's study.",
    "translation": "这些特征使它们成为布罗斯南博士和德瓦尔博士研究的完美候选者。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P2-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P2-S4",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "The researchers spent two years teaching their monkeys to exchange tokens for food.",
    "translation": "研究人员花了两年时间教猴子用代币交换食物。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P2-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P2-S5",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "Normally, the monkeys were happy enough to exchange pieces of rock for slices of cucumber.",
    "translation": "通常情况下，猴子很乐意用石头换黄瓜片。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P2-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P2-S6",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "However, when two monkeys were placed in separate but adjoining chambers, so that each could observe what the other was getting in return for its rock, their behaviour became markedly different.",
    "translation": "然而，当两只猴子被放置在单独但相邻的房间中，以便每只猴子都可以观察另一只猴子从石头中得到什么回报时，它们的行为变得明显不同。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 2,
      "sentence": 7,
      "ps": "P2-S7"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 7,
      "id": "P2-S7",
      "pIndex": 2
    },
    "text": "In the world of capuchins grapes are luxury goods (and much preferable to cucumbers).",
    "translation": "在卷尾猴的世界里，葡萄是奢侈品（而且比黄瓜更受欢迎）。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 1,
      "ps": "P3-S1"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 1,
      "id": "P3-S1",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "So when one monkey was handed a grape in exchange for her token, the second was reluctant to hand hers over for a mere piece of cucumber.",
    "translation": "因此，当一只猴子被递上一颗葡萄来换取她的代币时，第二只猴子却不愿意仅仅为了一块黄瓜而交出她的葡萄。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": true,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 2,
      "ps": "P3-S2"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 2,
      "id": "P3-S2",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "And if one received a grape without having to provide her token in exchange at all, the other either tossed her own token at the researcher or out of the chamber, or refused to accept the slice of cucumber.",
    "translation": "如果一个人在根本不需要提供代币作为交换的情况下收到了一颗葡萄，另一个人要么把自己的代币扔给研究人员，要么扔出房间，或者拒绝接受这片黄瓜。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": true
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 3,
      "ps": "P3-S3"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 3,
      "id": "P3-S3",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Indeed, the mere presence of a grape in the other chamber (without an actual monkey to eat it) was enough to induce resentment in a female capuchin.",
    "translation": "事实上，仅仅在另一个房间里出现一颗葡萄（没有真正的猴子来吃它）就足以引起雌性卷尾猴的不满。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 4,
      "ps": "P3-S4"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 4,
      "id": "P3-S4",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "The researchers suggest that capuchin monkeys, like humans, are guided by social emotions.",
    "translation": "研究人员认为，卷尾猴和人类一样，受到社会情绪的引导。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 5,
      "ps": "P3-S5"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 5,
      "id": "P3-S5",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "In the wild, they are a co-operative, group-living species.",
    "translation": "在野外，它们是一种合作、群体生活的物种。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
      "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
      "extractedAt": "2026-09-18T23:13:00+0800",
      "contentHash": "sha256:d635bde360d44aa42022b57507e8c14538b3a197459d7c7030244c9ce53edbed"
    }
  },
  {
    "schemaVersion": "kaoyan-existing-sentence-1.0",
    "source": "production",
    "articleKey": "ky-en1-2005-r-t1",
    "location": {
      "paragraph": 3,
      "sentence": 6,
      "ps": "P3-S6"
    },
    "sourceLocator": {
      "sIndex": 6,
      "id": "P3-S6",
      "pIndex": 3
    },
    "text": "Such co-operation is likely to be stable only when each animal feels it is not being cheated.",
    "translation": "只有当每只动物都感觉自己没有被欺骗时，这种合作才可能是稳定的。",
    "syntaxAnalysis": null,
    "rawFields": {
      "isTopicSentence": false,
      "isKeyEvidence": false
    },
    "provenance": {
      "sourceLayer": "production",
      "sourceFile": "题库/英语/data_2005.js",
      "year": 2005,
